ave switched to the Eevee renderer and set the render settings for resolution and FPS to 854x480 at 15 FPS.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"manage_task","args":{"Action":"status","TaskId":"6f71b575-d73e-4413-b861-a66d8f356c8c/task-160","toolAction":"Checking Manim render status","toolSummary":"Check Manim Status"}}]}
